      "text": "A very small (8 by 15 pixel) image fragment from the cover page. At this size the fragment appears blank or near-uniform in colour, and its content could not be determined from the extracted image; given its size and position among 71 images extracted from the cover, it most likely represents a small piece of the stylized title-text or background composition rather than a standalone figure.",
